      {
        "sha": "7331c23da9e6f1510d89ea651d0dea77a57b3252",
        "message": "Fix MergingPress merge_fraction to rank within the eligible tokens \ud83e\udd16\ud83e\udd16\ud83e\udd16 (#287)\n\nThe fraction gate took the (1 - merge_fraction) quantile of the whole row after\nsetting threshold-rejected tokens to -inf. That quantile is a share of all\nevicted tokens, so the share of eligible tokens that merged depended on the\nrejection rate of the row. Rank within the eligible set of each row instead,\nfollowing the idiom of torch.nn.utils.prune.PruningContainer._combine_masks.\n\nAdds tests for the merged share at several rejection rates, for rows with\nheterogeneous rejection rates, and for merge_fraction=1.0.\n\nSigned-off-by: jg-codes <53511569+jg-codes@users.noreply.github.com>"
      },
